1
00:01:26,783 --> 00:01:30,850
O REINO PROIBIDO

2
00:01:32,512 --> 00:01:36,512
Tradução: NaNNa,
frankensubber e macflii

3
00:01:37,512 --> 00:01:41,512
Sincronia: NaNNa
Ressync DVDRip: paulostriker

4
